        ``10*(i - 1) + 0``, ``10*(i - 1) + 1`` and ``10*(i - 1) + 2``, are
        the Hermite functions `H_i`, `H_{xi}` and `H_{yi}` of the Notes
        of :mod:`bfsccylinder.bfsccylinder` evaluated at ``xi``, ``eta``, such
        that `u = \boldsymbol{S}^u\boldsymbol{u}_e`.

