        \boldsymbol{K}_{GNL} = \int_A \boldsymbol{G}^\top \begin{bmatrix} N_{NLxx} & N_{NLxy} \\
        N_{NLxy} & N_{NLyy} \end{bmatrix} \boldsymbol{G} dA

