    ``ley``, ``R`` and the stiffnesses of ``shell`` must be set. ``Nxx``,
    ``Nyy`` and ``Nxy`` are those of the linear strains, such that the values
    are linear in ``u``; the corresponding term of the nonlinear strains is
    in :func:`.update_KCNL`.

